2026-08-16T13:59:27Z    [DE:Diluted EPS (GAAP)] GATE critic: Wrong anchor period: You based the FY2026Q3 GAAP diluted EPS on FY2024Q3’s $6.29 and “compounded over 2 years,” asserting no prior-year figure. For FY2026Q3 the correct like-for-like prior-year comparable is FY2025Q3 (which should be available by now), not FY2024Q3. Using FY2024Q3 as the base is a concrete period mismatch that invalidates the 6.75971 estimate.
2026-08-16T14:00:15Z    [DE:Production & Precision Ag operating profit] GATE critic: The -12.65% YoY you applied is on the wrong basis: you constructed it by weighting two unrelated historical YoY changes, including FY2020Q3→FY2021Q3 of +49.8%, which is a non-adjacent, out‑of‑cycle period. For FY2026Q3 you should not blend in 2020→2021 to set a YoY for 2026. The only concrete YoY datapoint you cite for this segment is FY2024Q3→FY2025Q3 at about -50.1% (with FY2025Q3 operating profit $580m vs $1,162m), which directly contradicts the -12.65% assumption and would imply a much lower figure than $506.6m off the $580m base. This makes the $506.6m projection wrong in basis.
